---
import "../../pro-os.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101714" />
  <meta name="description" content="avocadoPro OS browser preview: a focused workspace for Eve, Smith, your work, and Pro hardware." />
  <meta property="og:title" content="avocadoPro OS — Your work starts here" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="A browser preview of the dedicated AI PC workspace." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocadopro.si/" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocadopro.si/" />
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <title>avocadoPro OS — Your work starts here</title>
</head>
<body class="pro-os">
  <a class="skip" href="#workspace">Skip to workspace</a>
  <div class="os-shell">
    <aside class="rail" aria-label="OS navigation">
      <a class="rail-logo" href="/pro/" aria-label="avocadoPro OS home"><img src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" /></a>
      <nav class="rail-nav" aria-label="Workspace apps">
        <button type="button" data-view="home" aria-current="page" title="Home"><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><span>Home</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-view="eve" title="Eve"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span>Eve</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-view="work" title="Work"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span><span>Work</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-view="system" title="System"><span aria-hidden="true">▣</span><span>System</span></button>
      </nav>
      <div class="rail-bottom"><a href="https://avoado.si/" title="Open Smith">↗<span>Smith</span></a></div>
    </aside>

    <div class="os-main">
      <header class="os-topbar">
        <div class="os-identity"><span class="os-identity-dot"></span><strong>avocado<span>Pro</span></strong><em>OS PREVIEW</em></div>
        <div class="os-top-right"><span class="session-badge"><i></i> Browser session</span><span id="os-clock" aria-label="Current time"></span><a class="top-hardware" href="/build/">Explore Pro hardware ↗</a></div>
      </header>
      <main id="workspace">
        <section class="view view-home" data-panel="home">
          <div class="home-head"><p class="eyebrow">PRO WORKSPACE / 01</p><h1>Your workspace.<br /><span>Ready when you are.</span></h1><p>Start a task, pick up an idea, or open Eve. Everything begins here.</p></div>
          <div class="home-grid">
            <section class="start-card surface" aria-labelledby="start-title"><div class="section-label"><span class="mark">✳</span><span>EVE / YOUR CREATIVE START</span><span class="section-index">01</span></div><h2 id="start-title">What do you want to make?</h2><p>Describe a task, a design, or a question. Your draft stays in this browser until you choose to copy it.</p><textarea data-draft-input rows="3" maxlength="3000" placeholder="I want to create…" aria-label="Draft for Eve"></textarea><div class="composer-footer"><span data-draft-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Saved on this device only</span><div><button type="button" data-copy-draft>Copy draft</button><a class="action" href="https://avoado.si/os/eve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Eve <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>
            <section class="system-card surface" aria-labelledby="system-title"><div class="section-label"><span class="mark">▣</span><span>YOUR MACHINE</span><span class="section-index">02</span></div><div class="machine-visual"><div class="machine-box"><span class="machine-vent"></span><span class="machine-word">pro</span></div><div class="machine-shadow"></div></div><h2 id="system-title">Built for your next idea.</h2><p>Explore the planned Pro hardware and configure a first build.</p><a href="/build/" class="text-action">Explore and configure <span>↗</span></a></section>
            <section class="work-card surface" aria-labelledby="work-title"><div class="section-label"><span class="mark">▤</span><span>YOUR WORK</span><span class="section-index">03</span></div><h2 id="work-title">Keep the thread.</h2><p>Capture a few things you want to work on. This planning board is local to this browser.</p><form data-task-form><label for="quick-task" class="sr-only">New task</label><input id="quick-task" name="task" maxlength="160" placeholder="Add an idea or next step" required /><button type="submit" aria-label="Add task">＋</button></form><ul data-task-list class="task-list" aria-label="Local tasks"></ul><button type="button" class="text-action" data-view="work">Open work board <span>↗</span></button></section>
            <section class="sky-card surface" aria-labelledby="sky-title"><div class="section-label"><span class="mark">✺</span><span>Smith / CONNECTIONS</span><span class="section-index">04</span></div><h2 id="sky-title">Bring in the right tools.</h2><p>Find agents and tools in smis. Review access and estimated usage before starting real work.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://avoado.si/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Smith <span>↗</span></a><div class="flow-mini"><span>IDEA</span><b></b><span>EVE</span><b></b><span>Smith</span><b></b><span>RESULT</span></div></section>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="view" data-panel="eve" hidden><div class="panel-head"><p class="eyebrow">EVE / AI WORKSPACE</p><h1>Start with your idea.</h1><p>Eve is the LLM entrance for conversation, planning, approvals, progress, and results. This Pro preview saves a draft locally; actual AI work opens in the RockstarOS service.</p></div><div class="panel-grid"><div class="surface panel-primary"><span class="panel-num">01 / PREPARE</span><h2>Your draft</h2><textarea data-draft-input rows="8" maxlength="3000" placeholder="I want to create…" aria-label="Draft for Eve"></textarea><div class="composer-footer"><span data-draft-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Saved on this device only</span><div><button type="button" data-copy-draft>Copy draft</button><a class="action" href="https://avoado.si/os/eve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Eve ↗</a></div></div></div><div class="surface panel-note"><span class="panel-num">02 / BEFORE EXECUTION</span><h2>Know what runs.</h2><ul><li>Choose the model or connected Tool.</li><li>See the estimate and approve a limit.</li><li>Follow the job and inspect its result.</li></ul><p>Nothing typed in this preview starts an agent or creates a charge.</p></div></div></section>

        <section class="view" data-panel="work" hidden><div class="panel-head"><p class="eyebrow">WORK / LOCAL BOARD</p><h1>Keep momentum.</h1><p>A lightweight board for ideas and next steps on this browser. Real jobs and cross-device history live in Eve and Zema.</p></div><div class="panel-grid"><div class="surface panel-primary"><span class="panel-num">01 / YOUR NOTES</span><h2>Next steps</h2><form data-task-form><label for="board-task" class="sr-only">New task</label><input id="board-task" name="task" maxlength="160" placeholder="Add a next step" required /><button type="submit" aria-label="Add task">＋</button></form><ul data-task-list class="task-list" aria-label="Local tasks"></ul><div class="board-actions"><button type="button" data-export-board>Export board</button><button type="button" data-clear-board>Clear completed</button></div><p class="helper" data-board-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="surface panel-note"><span class="panel-num">02 / REAL JOBS</span><h2>From plan to result.</h2><p>For approved agents, progress, cost, and results, continue in the connected service.</p><a class="text-action" href="https://avoado.si/os/eve" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Eve and jobs ↗</a></div></div></section>

        <section class="view" data-panel="system" hidden><div class="panel-head"><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEM / PRO</p><h1>One system.<br />A machine for making.</h1><p>This browser workspace previews the Pro screen. Hardware validation, native image, local inference, and physical shipping are separate acceptance steps.</p></div><div class="panel-grid"><div class="surface panel-primary system-overview"><span class="panel-num">01 / PRO HARDWARE</span><img src="/images/avocado-pro-studio-concept.webp" alt="Concept render of a compact silver avocadoPro computer" /><h2>Configure your Pro.</h2><p>Review component references and submit first-build interest. Compatibility, final price, and delivery date are still being validated.</p><a class="action" href="/build/">Open hardware configurator ↗</a></div><div class="surface panel-note"><span class="panel-num">02 / ENVIRONMENT</span><h2>Current session</h2><dl><div><dt>Interface</dt><dd>Browser preview</dd></div><div><dt>Storage</dt><dd>Local browser only</dd></div><div><dt>Compute</dt><dd>No local Pro connected</dd></div><div><dt>AI jobs</dt><dd>Open in Eve</dd></div></dl><h2>Move private notes safely</h2><p>Preview and export this browser’s original draft and board. Account migration is not connected. This does not start jobs, AI, or payment. Existing Eve history stays in its current account.</p><button type="button" data-migration-prepare>Preview original notes</button><label>Preview an export file <input type="file" accept="application/json,.json" data-migration-file /></label><pre data-migration-preview style="white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;max-height:20rem;overflow:auto" aria-label="Private notes preview"></pre><label><input type="checkbox" data-migration-consent /> I reviewed these private notes and want to save a file on this device.</label><button type="button" data-migration-download disabled>Export reviewed private file</button><button type="button" data-migration-cancel>Cancel preview</button><p data-migration-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Original browser keys are retained. No account migration has occurred.</p><button type="button" data-clear-all>Erase local preview data</button><p class="helper" data-system-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section>
      </main>
      <footer class="os-footer"><span>avocadoPro OS · Browser preview</span><nav aria-label="Related destinations"><a href="https://avoado.si/">Smith</a><a href="https://avocadomini.si/">avocadoMini</a><a href="/build/">Pro hardware</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></nav></footer>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>import "../../pro-os.js";</script>
</body>
</html>
